---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Shop — Azeroth" page="shop"><section class="page-hero wrap"><p class="eyebrow">Realm store</p><h1>Shop</h1><p>Browse available items and receive purchases safely through the delivery queue.</p><div id="shop-meta" class="shop-meta"></div></section><section class="wrap credit-store"><div><p class="eyebrow">Portal wallet</p><h2>Purchase credits</h2><p>Payments are verified server-side before credits reach your wallet.</p></div><div class="credit-packages"><button data-credit-package="small"><b>100</b><span>credits</span></button><button data-credit-package="medium"><b>550</b><span>credits</span></button><button data-credit-package="large"><b>1,200</b><span>credits</span></button></div></section><section class="wrap content-section"><div id="shop-filters" class="filters"></div><div id="product-grid" class="product-grid loading-grid"><div class="skeleton"></div><div class="skeleton"></div><div class="skeleton"></div></div></section><dialog id="purchase-dialog"><button class="dialog-close" aria-label="Close">×</button><p class="eyebrow">Confirm order</p><h2 id="purchase-title">Purchase</h2><p>Choose an offline character. The order is queued for safe in-game delivery.</p><label>Character<select id="purchase-character"></select></label><label>Coupon (optional)<input id="purchase-coupon" maxlength="40" placeholder="WELCOME"/></label><div class="order-total"><span>Total before discount</span><strong id="purchase-price"></strong></div><button id="purchase-confirm" class="button full">Queue delivery →</button><p class="form-message"></p></dialog></Layout>
